aragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙiAnd those which remain shall hear, and fear, and shall henceforth commit no more any such evil among you.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙuAnd thine eye shall not pity; but life shall go for life, eye for eye, tooth for tooth, hand for hand, foot for foot.¦layout ªlast_verse